{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Rockman and Rush run off to start a patrol around the city. The snarling drop bear hangs on to Rush's collar, screaming.","created_at":"2020-08-04T21:44:01.430000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740324189898014765","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
