{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"||\"prepared is good so we don't lose more while we find one.\"|| Selene nods contemplatively","created_at":"2020-08-04T21:45:04.939000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740324456274198628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“Of the three of us wishing to be mayor, we understand each of us has our own strengths and weaknesses. Each of us can lead this town in different ways that can be beneficial for everyone. However, we are not infallible. Each of us can potentially make a mistake.”","created_at":"2020-08-04T21:45:37.217000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740324591657811968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“With that being, we have decided collectively, to instead of all run for mayor, form a council. One where each of could lead where our strengths lie best, while also helping each other from making mistakes.”","created_at":"2020-08-04T21:45:39.680000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740324601988644944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
