{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Selene looks slightly disappointed that this isn't about what they'd hoped for.","created_at":"2020-08-04T21:46:43.028000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740324867689283715","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“All three of us believe this idea to be the best course of action for the betterment of the future of our town. However we would like to hear how you’d all feel about it. Would you guys accept a council, instead of a mayor? Or would you prefer a mayor? This discussion is open to everyone here. All voices will be heard.”","created_at":"2020-08-04T21:46:52.090000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740324905698197594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
